[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5340.109, "timestamp": "01:29:00", "text": "我看不见。真鱼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5344.03, "timestamp": "01:29:04", "text": "哇，真有意思。然后，就像往常一样，啊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5346.629, "timestamp": "01:29:06", "text": "它来了，它来了，它来了。类似直播之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5349.91, "timestamp": "01:29:09", "text": "即使你不是主播，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5352.149, "timestamp": "01:29:12", "text": "看起来和朋友一起做这件事会非常有趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5354.91, "timestamp": "01:29:14", "text": "是。这场比赛的亮点出现了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5357.83, "timestamp": "01:29:17", "text": "。今晚灯亮了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5361.27, "timestamp": "01:29:21", "text": "真是太有趣了，不是吗？大约6人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5364.75, "timestamp": "01:29:24", "text": "我觉得差不多就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5368.79, "timestamp": "01:29:28", "text": "两个人就能做到。哦，我睡着了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5373.51, "timestamp": "01:29:33", "text": "。当我入睡时，我的眼前景象就像我入睡前看到的画面一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5376.229, "timestamp": "01:29:36", "text": "我做到了。是的。操作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5380.51, "timestamp": "01:29:40", "text": "这肯定比用针头好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5383.47, "timestamp": "01:29:43", "text": "我觉得34个人更有趣，但6个人也挺好玩的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5387.149, "timestamp": "01:29:47", "text": "如果人那么多，这个谜题可能很容易解开，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5390.709, "timestamp": "01:29:50", "text": "六个是合适的数字，因为再多就难以管理了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5393.229, "timestamp": "01:29:53", "text": "看起来差不多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5396.87, "timestamp": "01:29:56", "text": "真是太搞笑了。"}]